<title>JAPAN: Nissan Diesel - 96/97 parent results.</title>
<headline>Nissan Diesel - 96/97 parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
